# Supabase (Prayer wall — shared across devices)
# 1) Run supabase/prayer-wall.sql in the Supabase SQL editor.
# 2) Also run supabase/app-feedback.sql and supabase/rls-harden.sql.
# 3) Paste URL + key below, then restart `astro dev` / redeploy.
#
# Use either:
#   - Legacy anon key (starts with eyJ…) from Settings → API Keys → Legacy
#   - OR publishable key (sb_publishable_…) from Settings → API Keys
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key

# OneSignal (optional — push when the app is closed)
# 1) Create a Web Push app at https://onesignal.com — paste App ID here.
# 2) Site URL = your production https domain; enable HTTPS.
# 3) In OneSignal: Messages → Journeys (or Scheduled)
#    Filter users where tag reminder_enabled = 1
#    Use tags reminder_hour, reminder_minute, reminder_tz for local time
# 4) The app sets those tags when Daily Reminder is turned on (Journey page).
# PUBLIC_ONESIGNAL_APP_ID=

# Feedback form (optional — Support page)
# Paste a Google Form (or similar) link. Leave empty to hide external form CTA.
# PUBLIC_FEEDBACK_FORM_URL=https://forms.gle/your-form-id
